{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879362",
      "title": "Using Nested Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 180,
      "videoOrder": 156,
      "sourceHash": "b3bf40b752cabc08de709c4df9214fdbda4c9d49fb2c10ede5d16f0c054da53d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.613,
          "end": 3.46,
          "en": "There are more things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.46,
          "end": 6.03,
          "en": "you can configure when it comes to your routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.03,
          "end": 8.14,
          "en": "which you set up on your router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.14,
          "end": 9.08,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.08,
          "end": 13.97,
          "en": "we have this pretty nice feature of nested routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.97,
          "end": 17.16,
          "en": "In some applications, you might want to have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.16,
          "end": 20.21,
          "en": "you can say a router inside of another router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.21,
          "end": 21.91,
          "en": "Let me give you an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.91,
          "end": 24.84,
          "en": "Let's say our team members should not be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.84,
          "end": 27.31,
          "en": "on a new stand alone page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.31,
          "end": 29.96,
          "en": "but instead when I click view members here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.96,
          "end": 31.47,
          "en": "I want to load the members",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.47,
          "end": 35.44,
          "en": "for that team above the list of teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.44,
          "end": 39.06,
          "en": "So, on the same page I want to embed my members",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.06,
          "end": 39.97,
          "en": "of that team.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.97,
          "end": 43.27,
          "en": "That's something which you might wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.27,
          "end": 47.53,
          "en": "And that's something which is possible with the Vue Router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.53,
          "end": 50.39,
          "en": "We got this route here which is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.39,
          "end": 52.03,
          "en": "for loading our team members",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.03,
          "end": 56.38,
          "en": "and currently it's a stand alone route to find next",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.38,
          "end": 59.61,
          "en": "to the teams route basically on the root level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.61,
          "end": 61.15,
          "en": "of all our routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.15,
          "end": 64.89,
          "en": "These routes are all on the same level.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.89,
          "end": 66.44,
          "en": "They're siblings to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.5,
          "end": 69.75,
          "en": "Now you can set up a nested route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.75,
          "end": 73.09,
          "en": "by going to the route where you want to nest routes inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.09,
          "end": 76.893,
          "en": "and adding the children option on the route config.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.88,
          "end": 79.52,
          "en": "Children takes an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.52,
          "end": 82.49,
          "en": "and it takes an array of routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.49,
          "end": 85.48,
          "en": "So, the same routes we set up here in routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.48,
          "end": 87.65,
          "en": "are added to children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.65,
          "end": 91.6,
          "en": "So, here on teams we can now take this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.7,
          "end": 94.32,
          "en": "and move it in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.32,
          "end": 97.27000000000001,
          "en": "and now I reformatted this to make it a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.22999999999999,
          "end": 100.56,
          "en": "So, now inside of my teams route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.56,
          "end": 103.75,
          "en": "I have a child route which is this one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.75,
          "end": 107,
          "en": "And here you don't need to repeat the entire path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107,
          "end": 109.45,
          "en": "You can just add the segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.45,
          "end": 112.08,
          "en": "which should go after this segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.08,
          "end": 114.86,
          "en": "So after slash teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.86,
          "end": 118,
          "en": "And you can have more than one route in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118,
          "end": 119.75,
          "en": "If you had multiple routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.75,
          "end": 121.61,
          "en": "that should be nested inside of teams",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.61,
          "end": 123.943,
          "en": "you could absolutely add them there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.99,
          "end": 127,
          "en": "Here I just needed one route though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127,
          "end": 129.27,
          "en": "but this route will now be reached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.27,
          "end": 133.263,
          "en": "with teams slash and then some Id like t1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.6,
          "end": 135.99,
          "en": "And, now what's the difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.99,
          "end": 138.02,
          "en": "with having a nested route?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.02,
          "end": 140.71,
          "en": "Well one difference is that if I save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.71,
          "end": 142.56,
          "en": "if I click view members",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 146.75,
          "en": "now we don't load our team members route anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.75,
          "end": 148.3,
          "en": "And the reason for that is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.3,
          "end": 151.32999999999998,
          "en": "that Vue, the Vue Router to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.32999999999998,
          "end": 154.44,
          "en": "doesn't know anymore where to load this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.44,
          "end": 157.73,
          "en": "Because now the team members route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.73,
          "end": 158.85,
          "en": "this one here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.85,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "is no longer a root route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.7,
          "end": 165.28,
          "en": "It's no longer registered directly inside of routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 165.28,
          "end": 167.603,
          "en": "It's a child route of another route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 168.64,
          "end": 171.18,
          "en": "Now the router-view component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 171.18,
          "end": 172.91,
          "en": "which we use is app view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.91,
          "end": 175.88,
          "en": "is our top most router-view component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.88,
          "end": 177.2,
          "en": "we have in this entire app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.2,
          "end": 180.68,
          "en": "and it's only responsible for the root routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.68,
          "end": 183.5,
          "en": "So, for the routes directly registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 183.5,
          "end": 185.07,
          "en": "in the routes array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 185.07,
          "end": 188.01,
          "en": "So, this child route cannot be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.01,
          "end": 189.96,
          "en": "into this router-view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 189.96,
          "end": 194.5,
          "en": "Instead you now need to add a second Router Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.5,
          "end": 197.73,
          "en": "in the component where this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 197.73,
          "end": 200.01,
          "en": "is defined as a child component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.01,
          "end": 202.72,
          "en": "So, in this case in our teams list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.72,
          "end": 204.3,
          "en": "that's the real component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 204.3,
          "end": 207.05,
          "en": "which has this as a child route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.05,
          "end": 209.07999999999998,
          "en": "So, it's the teams list opponent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 209.07999999999998,
          "end": 212.65,
          "en": "where you now need to add an extra router-view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 212.65,
          "end": 214.78,
          "en": "for all the child routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 214.78,
          "end": 217.7,
          "en": "In this case for the one child route we got.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 217.7,
          "end": 219.25,
          "en": "So, in teams list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 219.25,
          "end": 221.6,
          "en": "above the unordered list for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 221.6,
          "end": 224.173,
          "en": "we can now add another router-view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 226.25,
          "end": 228.57,
          "en": "And this router-view will now be important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 228.57,
          "end": 230.32999999999998,
          "en": "for all the child routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 230.32999999999998,
          "end": 232.37,
          "en": "of the teams list component route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 232.37,
          "end": 234.19,
          "en": "So, of this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 234.19,
          "end": 236.71,
          "en": "Hence, now if I go back to teams",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 236.71,
          "end": 240.35,
          "en": "and reload we see nothing because it's just slash teams",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 240.35,
          "end": 242.24,
          "en": "but if I click on view members,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 242.24,
          "end": 245.89,
          "en": "now we see our members for that team.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 245.89,
          "end": 247.67,
          "en": "If I change the team here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 247.67,
          "end": 249.763,
          "en": "you'll see that updates up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 250.74,
          "end": 253.23,
          "en": "And of course we can do this for all the teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 253.23,
          "end": 255.13,
          "en": "And, that's another nice feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 255.13,
          "end": 257.64,
          "en": "having these nested routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 257.64,
          "end": 258.72,
          "en": "You will also notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 258.72,
          "end": 260.5,
          "en": "that with the nested route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 260.5,
          "end": 263.57,
          "en": "if my URL changes to that nested route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 263.57,
          "end": 266.17,
          "en": "teams is still highlighted up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 266.17,
          "end": 269.01,
          "en": "It wasn't before if you recognized that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 269.01,
          "end": 271.39,
          "en": "Before where this route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 271.39,
          "end": 275.83,
          "en": "was a separate root route as a sibling to the teams route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 275.83,
          "end": 279.15999999999997,
          "en": "before even though that route also started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 279.15999999999997,
          "end": 280.79,
          "en": "with slash teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 280.79,
          "end": 284.04,
          "en": "This link was not highlighted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 284.04,
          "end": 286.47,
          "en": "because the active clauses only applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 286.47,
          "end": 288.3,
          "en": "if the currently loaded path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 288.3,
          "end": 292.27,
          "en": "is actually related to the path this link points at.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 292.27,
          "end": 294.65,
          "en": "And, this link points at slash teams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 294.65,
          "end": 298.72,
          "en": "slash teams t1, is now a nested route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 298.72,
          "end": 299.95,
          "en": "on this teams route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 299.95,
          "end": 304.18,
          "en": "and therefore whenever some nested route is active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 304.18,
          "end": 306.66,
          "en": "this link is treated as active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 306.66,
          "end": 308.855,
          "en": "That's why now the active CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 308.855,
          "end": 310.25,
          "en": "is now being added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 310.25,
          "end": 315.16,
          "en": "But that's just a extra side note, related to nested routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 315.16,
          "end": 318.66,
          "en": "And nested routes can be a really useful feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 318.66,
          "end": 321.67,
          "en": "for building complex user interfaces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 321.67,
          "end": 324.66,
          "en": "where you want to load different parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 324.66,
          "end": 327.19,
          "en": "maybe nested in different components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 327.19,
          "end": 330.44,
          "en": "based on different URLs and paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 330.44,
          "end": 332.513,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we're doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
